<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>英语-VICE</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 17:52:49 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>万智牌 - 竞技场终于增加了分裂双胞胎组合</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/magic-the-gathering-arena-finally-adds-splinter-twin-combo/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;由于新的竞技场动力立方体更新，万智牌的标志性分裂双胞胎组合将于本周登陆万智牌竞技场。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;后&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/magic-the-gathering-arena-finally-adds-splinter-twin-combo/"&gt;万智牌 - 竞技场终于添加了分裂双胞胎组合&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 17:31:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/magic-the-gathering-arena-finally-adds-splinter-twin-combo/</guid></item><item><title>北卡罗来纳州男子在搞笑视频中用重金属吉他即兴演奏吓跑了熊一家</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/north-carolina-man-uses-heavy-metal-guitar-riffs-to-scare-off-family-of-bears-in-hilarious-video/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;2026 年 4 月的一段视频最近在网上疯传，视频中一名北卡罗来纳州男子在自家门廊上弹奏重金属吉他来吓跑熊。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/north-carolina-man-uses-heavy-metal-guitar-riffs-to-scare-off-family-of-bears-in-hilarious-video/"&gt;北卡罗来纳州男子在搞笑视频中用重金属吉他即兴演奏吓跑熊家族的&lt;/a&gt;帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 16:49:10 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/north-carolina-man-uses-heavy-metal-guitar-riffs-to-scare-off-family-of-bears-in-hilarious-video/</guid></item><item><title>如果 Ali G 诞生于 2026 年，他会做什么？</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/if-ali-g-were-created-in-2026-what-would-he-be-doing/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;欢迎来到《LOST WEEKEND》，VICE 的宿醉新闻发布会。很难说清楚我们当前的文化时刻到底是什么，亿万富翁喜剧演员萨莎·拜伦·科恩 (Sacha Baron Cohen) 复活了 Ali G 的尸体，而不是让他继